vue_app/.chartcheck/

# Ad-hoc diagnostic scripts that hold credentials or per-developer paths.
# A `wfadmin` Postgres password was committed in scripts/ on 2026-04-10 and stayed
# readable in a PUBLIC repo for five months (rotated Sep 11 2026). Keeping these
# untracked BY HAND is what failed; this is the rule that was missing.
#
# CONVENTION: name anything ad-hoc `scripts/local_*` and it is ignored automatically.
# Do NOT blanket-ignore scripts/ — the committed *_check.py guardrails live there.
scripts/local_*
# The known one-off diagnostics from the Aug 2026 One Pager audit (they embed the PG
# password and per-developer OneDrive paths; they live on developers' machines).
scripts/inv1*.py
scripts/inv2*.py
scripts/inv34*.py
scripts/inv5*.py
scripts/fixB_verify.py
scripts/burton_relmap.py
scripts/burton_blastradius.py
scripts/burton_loandump.py
scripts/pull_live_noi_requested.py
